    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Opening belt cover reveals modelled stepped pulleys and a belt, the top view shows the full drive train, and the chuck, drill bit, three-spoke feed handle, adjustable table, motor and coiled power cable are all separate. Cast green enamel with edge wear is consistent all round. 58.5k tris, the heaviest in this batch.",
    "limitations": [
      "58.5k triangles; decimate if you need it as a background prop.",
      "Belt cover is modelled open and the feed handle is in a fixed position."
    ],
